{"w":2400,"h":3395,"lines":[{"c":1,"x":0.12749262901474018,"h":0.013434623520562461,"w":0.057771943410237614,"t":"Test 3","y":0.10447454868031114},{"y":0.14811542992141224,"x":0.12757201636062926,"w":0.16666666666666669,"h":0.01472320376914027,"c":1,"t":"Questions 37-40"},{"y":0.18015925661852528,"w":0.34588442484537762,"t":"Choose the correct letter, A, B, C or D.","h":0.020201075343838526,"c":1,"x":0.12746799752427079},{"h":0.01724786275407586,"c":1,"y":0.21352968275814943,"w":0.54332702636718744,"t":"Write the correct letter in boxes 37-40 on your answer sheet.","x":0.12750349192273036},{"t":"37 What method did Jamie Tehrani use to test his ideas about fairy tales?","h":0.014572547939556646,"x":0.12551441153780113,"y":0.24705535916153776,"c":1,"w":0.66872426350911462},{"y":0.27217826876971007,"h":0.017349380205601506,"t":"He compared oral and written forms of the same stories.","x":0.21186846476961971,"w":0.50424112955729161,"c":1},{"y":0.28839147898496265,"w":0.5186917114257813,"x":0.21390453122442921,"t":"He looked at many different forms of the same basic story.","c":1,"h":0.01899931989654069},{"x":0.17078189305329233,"y":0.3081395346727287,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.016460905075073223,"t":"C"},{"w":0.53909464518229167,"c":1,"x":0.21399177200962374,"h":0.014574259835502756,"t":"He looked at unrelated stories from many different countries.","y":0.30668604637629349},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"t":"D He contrasted the development of fairy tales with that of living creatures.","y":0.32267441845553613,"x":0.17078189833875229,"w":0.68724278767903635,"c":1},{"y":0.35600706731481757,"h":0.017667844522968212,"w":0.56995885213216146,"x":0.12757201424725645,"c":1,"t":"38 When discussing Tehrani's views, Jack Zipes suggests that"},{"t":"Tehrani ignores key changes in the role of women.","w":0.45085306803385417,"y":0.38026295956093015,"h":0.01952658721780054,"c":1,"x":0.21385173402347543},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"t":"stories which are too horrific are not always taken seriously.","w":0.5308642069498698,"y":0.39958775027837445,"x":0.21399176474008566,"c":1},{"h":0.01811983335425349,"c":1,"t":"Tehrani overemphasises the importance of violence in stories.","x":0.21391034252828348,"w":0.5515850830078125,"y":0.41411021128212899},{"y":0.43168433437207776,"h":0.015990084276322869,"x":0.21399177627807112,"w":0.58436213175455731,"c":1,"t":"features of stories only survive if they have a deeper significance."},{"t":"39 Why does Tehrani refer to Chinese and Japanese fairy tales?","c":1,"x":0.12749378739933931,"y":0.46432636216404721,"h":0.018555472680620966,"w":0.58661738077799486},{"w":0.40329218546549478,"c":1,"t":"to indicate that Jack Zipes' theory is incorrect","y":0.4896937572409028,"x":0.2139917679256888,"h":0.016195524146054074},{"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.016460905075073223,"t":"B","y":0.5087209299841905,"c":1,"x":0.17283950618674321},{"t":"C","x":0.17283950619262209,"y":0.52616279048668224,"h":0.013081395583944611,"c":1,"w":0.016460905075073251},{"w":0.016460905075073251,"h":0.013081395583944722,"c":1,"t":"D","y":0.54215116256413232,"x":0.17283950620731933},{"y":0.50709920860387281,"w":0.36649838765462239,"c":1,"x":0.2118142601599203,"t":"to suggest that crime is a global problem","h":0.018050834062663834},{"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.21193414842762062,"c":1,"t":"to imply that all fairy tales have a similar meaning","y":0.52470930217774103,"w":0.44032923380533862},{"c":1,"w":0.38932223002115884,"x":0.20764588550524696,"h":0.021351080760798613,"t":"to add more evidence for Jack Zipes' ideas","y":0.53861145963262069},{"t":"40 What does Mathias Clasen believe about fairy tales?","y":0.57412790682559622,"x":0.12757201461075676,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.51234568277994796},{"y":0.60029069752482023,"t":"They are a safe way of learning to deal with fear.","h":0.016022611984234936,"c":1,"w":0.43415639241536463,"x":0.21604937573790531},{"y":0.61773255791296955,"x":0.17283950620731933,"c":1,"t":"B","w":0.016460905075073251,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.016460905075073251,"h":0.011627907185728703,"c":1,"t":"C","y":0.63517441841710243,"x":0.17283950622201658},{"y":0.61600671494227366,"x":0.2159702761455469,"h":0.018147355114472963,"t":"They are a type of entertainment that some people avoid.","w":0.51042755126953132,"c":1},{"h":0.016022611984235047,"x":0.2139917689708562,"c":1,"t":"They reflect the changing values of our society.","w":0.41975308736165368,"y":0.63368669048092363},{"t":"D They reduce our ability to deal with real-world problems.","y":0.64958775025124205,"c":1,"x":0.17283949945474519,"h":0.017667844522968212,"w":0.54320988972981765},{"x":0.12962962915391335,"c":1,"t":"70","y":0.92296511610205512,"h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.026748971939086902},{"y":0.92167255574701512,"h":0.015606595995288575,"x":0.22596623853292763,"w":0.085224653879801437,"c":1,"t":"• p. 124"}]}